              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagenderria kuya mbere, akamaaha abhamura bhandë bhanda imui bhabhërë: Yakobho o Sebhetayo na Yohana mura omoobho, bhano wanyoorrë bharëngë köbhooto hamui na Sebhetayo, isawaabho, bharataabha ichinyero chaabho; akabhabhërëkëra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
