                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe naarë kuinaaranaara Gariraya yonsui, araigia guchisinagogi chaabho, na kurundia igichiiratë kiöbhögambi, na kuhuenia këra bhörooyi na këra öbhörosu köbhantö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichinkuma chaae chikarönda gönsë yonsui ya Samu, igo abhantö bhakamörentera abharooyi bhonsui bhano bhaarë kuiriira na amarooyi gi ichiteemo chonsui, bhano bhaarë na ibhihui, ichindoori, amasusu, Yesö akabhahuenia bhoonsui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amakomo amanene gakamösoorana kurua Gariraya, Tekabhori, Yerusaremu, Yutea na ihumbu ya Yorotani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.25",
